{"4787640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LANCELOT: The Silver Knight", "steam_appid": 4787640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4882410], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the legends of “<strong>Lancelot: The Silver Knight</strong>”, as he sets out on a quest to reclaim his<strong> title as a knight</strong>. A <strong>quirky </strong>top-down action-adventure game set in an <strong>mystical Brittany</strong> filled with <strong>enigmatic dungeons, legendary monsters</strong> and… <strong>chickens</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/cfbdd6738353e519743f936d53a3891f.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=1170 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/cfbdd6738353e519743f936d53a3891f.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/cfbdd6738353e519743f936d53a3891f.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fearsome <strong>Maleagant</strong>, taking advantage of <strong>Lancelot’s </strong>arrogance, manages to kidnap Princess <strong>Guinevere</strong>. The <strong>prophecy </strong>foretold by the <strong>Lady of the Lake, Viviane </strong>(and Lancelot's adoptive mother), is <strong>shattered</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d989a7588ff430fc57c1513ee486983d.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d989a7588ff430fc57c1513ee486983d.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d989a7588ff430fc57c1513ee486983d.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the <strong>kingdom of Brittany </strong>as <strong>Lancelot </strong>to find a way to make amends for all his <strong>mistakes</strong> and restore his (self-proclaimed) title of ‘<strong>greatest</strong>’ <strong>knight</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d544336b979ae0624bbb45d9b437891a.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=1170 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d544336b979ae0624bbb45d9b437891a.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d544336b979ae0624bbb45d9b437891a.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“A ball of wool?”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you on your quest, your mom is making you befriend a <strong>Magical Shawl...</strong> It's mandatory...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite his <strong>bad temper</strong>, the <strong>Shawl </strong>will help you <strong>solve puzzles</strong>, <strong>explore</strong>, <strong>face terrifying monsters</strong> by <strong>tying </strong>up everything in his path, and even learn <strong>new techniques</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“I play Strength, not Intelligence!”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>darkest dungeons</strong>, you’ll discover <strong>strange magical artefacts</strong> which, once <strong>fused</strong>, will change the way you use some of your <strong>equipment </strong>or even transform you into an<strong> adorable ermine</strong>. Who knows what will happen when you use them…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/eeec2163fcba587516e854d2208b44a8.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=1170 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/eeec2163fcba587516e854d2208b44a8.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/eeec2163fcba587516e854d2208b44a8.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world full of mystery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brittany </strong>is full of <strong>secrets</strong>. Will you find a <strong>treasure </strong>in a bush? Will you stumble upon a <strong>sanctuary </strong>deep within the <strong>mountain</strong>? Your curiosity will be rewarded.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/8841e2ede3ae039e56de671aa8c2f94a.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=800 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/8841e2ede3ae039e56de671aa8c2f94a.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/8841e2ede3ae039e56de671aa8c2f94a.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work is good for your health…</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish, with <span class=\"bb_strike\">greed</span> kindness, you can <strong>lend a hand to the quirky locals</strong> on their <strong>zany side quests</strong> and report your exploits to the <strong>Guardian of Nature</strong> in exchange for a few <strong>rewards</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >…Not working is the best way to preserve it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If being a hero is too tiring, there are <strong>plenty of mini-games</strong> to keep you entertained! We highly recommend “<strong>Chicken Toss</strong>”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re familiar with <strong>Arthurian legend</strong> or not, come and discover the <strong>iconic figures</strong> from the <strong>legend of Lancelot</strong>, both <strong>enemies </strong>and <strong>allies</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the legends of “<strong>Lancelot: The Silver Knight</strong>”, as he sets out on a quest to reclaim his<strong> title as a knight</strong>. A <strong>quirky </strong>top-down action-adventure game set in an <strong>mystical Brittany</strong> filled with <strong>enigmatic dungeons, legendary monsters</strong> and… <strong>chickens</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/cfbdd6738353e519743f936d53a3891f.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=1170 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/cfbdd6738353e519743f936d53a3891f.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/cfbdd6738353e519743f936d53a3891f.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fearsome <strong>Maleagant</strong>, taking advantage of <strong>Lancelot’s </strong>arrogance, manages to kidnap Princess <strong>Guinevere</strong>. The <strong>prophecy </strong>foretold by the <strong>Lady of the Lake, Viviane </strong>(and Lancelot's adoptive mother), is <strong>shattered</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d989a7588ff430fc57c1513ee486983d.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d989a7588ff430fc57c1513ee486983d.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d989a7588ff430fc57c1513ee486983d.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the <strong>kingdom of Brittany </strong>as <strong>Lancelot </strong>to find a way to make amends for all his <strong>mistakes</strong> and restore his (self-proclaimed) title of ‘<strong>greatest</strong>’ <strong>knight</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d544336b979ae0624bbb45d9b437891a.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=1170 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d544336b979ae0624bbb45d9b437891a.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/d544336b979ae0624bbb45d9b437891a.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“A ball of wool?”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you on your quest, your mom is making you befriend a <strong>Magical Shawl...</strong> It's mandatory...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite his <strong>bad temper</strong>, the <strong>Shawl </strong>will help you <strong>solve puzzles</strong>, <strong>explore</strong>, <strong>face terrifying monsters</strong> by <strong>tying </strong>up everything in his path, and even learn <strong>new techniques</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“I play Strength, not Intelligence!”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>darkest dungeons</strong>, you’ll discover <strong>strange magical artefacts</strong> which, once <strong>fused</strong>, will change the way you use some of your <strong>equipment </strong>or even transform you into an<strong> adorable ermine</strong>. Who knows what will happen when you use them…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/eeec2163fcba587516e854d2208b44a8.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=1170 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/eeec2163fcba587516e854d2208b44a8.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/eeec2163fcba587516e854d2208b44a8.mp4?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world full of mystery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brittany </strong>is full of <strong>secrets</strong>. Will you find a <strong>treasure </strong>in a bush? Will you stumble upon a <strong>sanctuary </strong>deep within the <strong>mountain</strong>? Your curiosity will be rewarded.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/8841e2ede3ae039e56de671aa8c2f94a.poster.avif?t=1785767764\" width=800 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/8841e2ede3ae039e56de671aa8c2f94a.webm?t=1785767764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787640/extras/8841e2ede3ae039e56de6